50
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.730
Well, there is a name for that.

51
00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.890
And it's called revenge bedtime procrastinating.

52
00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:31.080
And Huff Post reports,

53
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.560
We do it when our days are so busy that

54
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.620
we're fighting for some leisure time at night.

55
00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:39.610 line:15%
It is an act of revenge to get more time for yourself.

56
00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.540 line:15%
But the byproduct of this cycle is that

57
00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.529 line:15%
we're all wormed over piles of mud the next morning.

58
00:01:44.529 --> 00:01:47.126 line:15%
Cause we've just stayed up when we should be sleeping.

59
00:01:47.126 --> 00:01:48.984 line:15%
