78
00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:25.763
Sure.

79
00:02:25.763 --> 00:02:26.990
You shouldn't do it every night so you're exhausted,

80
00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:29.230
but I think it is important to

81
00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:30.610
