108
00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.340
I know.

109
00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.190
Interesting. Okay.

110
00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.950
Well, let's analyze that data.

111
00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.820
